        "subject": "Price list and payment categories on the portal and the console (0134)",
        "body": "Price list and payment categories on the portal and the console (0134)\n\n- Portal: the server's price list (per store and seat, 1/3/12 months),\n  then 'What are you paying for?' - subscription or renewal (open stores),\n  activating a new store (only when one waits), extra seats (one store,\n  how many - priced by GET my-subscription/payment-price), other (amount\n  and a required note). The plan cards are the server's, narrowed by\n  ?category=; the page computes no price (source rule kept).\n- Console: Record payment picks the category, months, stores and seats;\n  the amount is the server's price (businesses/:id/payment-price), typed\n  only for an adjustment. The payments table shows what each was for.\n- EN/FR/AR strings; tests for the price list and the categories.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
        "author": {
